  #line-at(90pt, 243.6pt, "ABSTRACT: ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(163.677pt, 243.6pt, "Solid-liquid interfacial thermal conductance (ITC) critically influences ")
  #line-at(90pt, 264.24pt, "heat transport in microfluidic, electronic, and energy systems, yet most optical ")
  #line-at(90pt, 284.88pt, "thermometry techniques are limited to specific metal-liquid interfaces. In this work, we ")
  #line-at(90pt, 305.76pt, "introduce a universal broadband square-pulsed thermometry method that enables ")
  #line-at(90pt, 326.4pt, "simultaneous quantification of ITC across a wide range of arbitrary solid-liquid ")
  #line-at(90pt, 347.04pt, "interfaces, while also providing accurate measurements of nanoscale liquid-film ")
  #line-at(90pt, 367.68pt, "thickness. To validate the method, we applied it to Al-water interfaces, yielding ITC ")
  #line-at(90pt, 388.8pt, "values in the range of 50-55 ")
